   {
    "id": "de-leva-1996",
    "citation": "de Leva, P. (1996). Adjustments to Zatsiorsky-Seluyanov's segment inertia parameters. Journal of Biomechanics 29(9), 1223-1230. Tables 4 (male) and 5 (female), segment mass fractions and centre-of-mass positions."
   },
   {
