    "citation": "Drillis, R., Contini, R. and Bluestein, M. (1964/1966). Body segment parameters: a survey of measurement techniques. Artificial Limbs 8(1), 44-66; segment lengths as fractions of stature."
   },
   {
    "id": "perry-burnfield-2010",
